#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:30
msgid "Welcome to the Dashboard!"
msgstr "Benvenuto nella Dashboard!"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:31
msgid "This is your central hub. Let's take a quick look at the key features."
msgstr "Questo è il tuo hub centrale. Vediamo le funzioni principali."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:36
msgid "Process Filter"
msgstr "Filtro Processo"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:37
msgid ""
"Use this dropdown to filter all the data on this page by a specific "
"document process, like 'Inbox' or 'Invoice'."
msgstr "Usa questo menu per filtrare i dati in base a un processo specifico."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:42
msgid "Key Metrics"
msgstr "Metriche chiave"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:43
msgid ""
"These cards show a live summary of your documents: Processed Today, "
"Processed This Week, and the Current Backlog."
msgstr "Queste schede mostrano un riepilogo in tempo reale dei tuoi documenti."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:48
msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "Analitica"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:49
msgid ""
"Visualize your throughput and status distribution with these interactive "
"charts."
msgstr "Visualizza il rendimento e la distribuzione con grafici interattivi."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:55
msgid ""
"This section provides a real-time view of the specific steps documents "
"are actively going through right now."
msgstr "Questa sezione mostra in tempo reale le fasi dei documenti attivi."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:61
msgid "Here you'll find a feed of the latest status changes for your documents."
msgstr "Qui troverai un feed degli ultimi cambi di stato dei tuoi documenti."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:63 templates/js/_tourJS.html:172
#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:214 templates/js/_tourJS.html:242
msgid "Finish"
msgstr "Fine"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:78
msgid "Workitems Overview"
msgstr "Panoramica elementi"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:79
msgid "This page lets you search, view, and manage all your workitems in detail."
msgstr ""
"Questa pagina ti permette di cercare e gestire tutti gli elementi in "
"dettaglio."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:84 templates/js/_tourJS.html:231
msgid "Search & Filter"
msgstr "Cerca e Filtra"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:85
msgid ""
"Use this powerful form to find specific workitems by process, search "
"terms, or tags."
msgstr "Usa questo modulo per trovare elementi specifici per processo o tag."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:90
msgid "Advanced Filters"
msgstr "Filtri avanzati"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:91
msgid ""
"Need more specific results? Click here to filter by date range, priority,"
" assigned user, or specific document field values."
msgstr "Filtra per data, priorità, utente assegnato o valori dei campi."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:96
msgid "Workitems Table"
msgstr "Tabella elementi"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:97
msgid ""
"Your filtered results appear here. You can sort columns by clicking on "
"their headers."
msgstr "I risultati compaiono qui. Puoi ordinare cliccando sulle intestazioni."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:102
msgid "View Details"
msgstr "Vedi dettagli"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:103
msgid ""
"Click this arrow button to expand a workitem. The tour will do this "
"automatically for the next step."
msgstr "Clicca la freccia per espandere l'elemento. Il tour lo farà in automatico."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:119
msgid "Process Timeline"
msgstr "Timeline processo"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:120
msgid ""
"Track the exact stage of your document (Import, Extraction, Validation, "
"Delivery) with this visual progress bar."
msgstr "Segui la fase esatta del documento con questa barra di progressione."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:138
msgid "Media Viewer"
msgstr "Visualizzatore media"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:139
msgid ""
"View the document image here. If permitted, you can interact with the "
"file."
msgstr "Visualizza l'immagine qui. Se permesso, puoi interagire con il file."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:145
msgid "History & Audit"
msgstr "Storico e Audit"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:146
msgid "See the complete audit trail and history of this specific document."
msgstr "Consulta la pista di audit completa e lo storico del documento."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:153
msgid "Review all extracted data fields and values associated with this document."
msgstr "Rivedi tutti i campi dati estratti e i valori associati."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:159
msgid "Collaboration Tools"
msgstr "Strumenti di collaborazione"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:160
msgid ""
"Here you can set a priority level, assign the workitem to a colleague, "
"add tags, and leave comments for your team."
msgstr "Imposta priorità, assegna compiti, aggiungi tag e lascia commenti."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:185
msgid "Welcome to the Team Board!"
msgstr "Benvenuto nella Bacheca Team!"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:186
msgid ""
"This Kanban-style board helps you visualize the workload and task "
"distribution across your entire team."
msgstr ""
"Questa bacheca Kanban ti aiuta a visualizzare il carico di lavoro del "
"team."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:191
msgid "Filter Tasks"
msgstr "Filtra Task"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:192
msgid ""
"Quickly find what you're looking for by filtering tasks by process or "
"priority level."
msgstr "Trova task filtrando per processo o livello di priorità."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:197
msgid "User Columns"
msgstr "Colonne utenti"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:198
msgid ""
"Each column represents a team member. All tasks assigned to them will "
"appear here."
msgstr "Ogni colonna è un membro del team. Qui vedi i task loro assegnati."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:203
msgid "Workload at a Glance"
msgstr "Carico di lavoro a colpo d'occhio"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:204
msgid ""
"The header shows the team member's name and the total number of tasks "
"currently assigned to them."
msgstr "L'intestazione mostra nome e numero totale di task assegnati."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:209
msgid "Task Cards"
msgstr "Schede task"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:210
msgid ""
"Each card is a workitem. It shows key details like the barcode, last "
"modification time, and priority. Click a card to jump to its detailed "
"view."
msgstr "Ogni scheda mostra barcode e priorità. Clicca per vedere i dettagli."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:226
msgid "View your billing history and manage your past invoices."
msgstr "Visualizza lo storico fatturazione e gestisci le tue fatture."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:232
msgid ""
"Locate specific invoices by searching for the invoice number, selecting a"
" date range, or filtering by payment status."
msgstr "Cerca fatture per numero, data o stato del pagamento."

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:237
msgid "Invoices List"
msgstr "Lista fatture"

#: templates/js/_tourJS.html:238
msgid ""
"Your filtered invoices appear here. You can view details, amounts, and "
"download PDF copies from the Actions column."
msgstr "Le fatture compaiono qui. Puoi vedere importi e scaricare il PDF."

